{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04735","headline":"奉和圣制喜雪应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制喜雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣德与天同，封峦欲报功。\n诏书期日下，灵感应时通。\n触石云呈瑞，含花雪告丰。\n积如沙照月，散似面从风。\n舞集仙台上，歌流帝乐中。\n遥知百神喜，洒路待行宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}